---
---

<section class="founder-section" id="founder">
    <div class="founder-container">

        <div class="founder-image">
            <img
                src="/owner/raju-kumar.jpg"
                alt="Raju Kumar - Founder of Rajubhai Travels"
            />
        </div>

        <div class="founder-content">

            <span class="founder-tag">
                Meet Our Founder
            </span>

            <h2>Raju Kumar</h2>

            <blockquote>
                "For us, every journey is more than just a trip.
                We believe in punctuality, safety, comfort, and
                treating every customer like family."
            </blockquote>

            <p>
                Raju Kumar founded <strong>Rajubhai Travels</strong> with
                a vision to provide reliable, affordable, and comfortable
                travel services for families, tourists, business travelers,
                and airport passengers. His dedication to quality service
                and customer satisfaction has been the foundation of the
                company's growth.
            </p>

            <p>
                Today, Rajubhai Travels proudly serves customers across
                Bengaluru and nearby destinations with professional service,
                well-maintained vehicles, and a customer-first approach.
                With a strong focus on safety, punctuality, and comfort,
                the company continues to earn the trust of its customers
                and plans to expand its fleet to serve even more travelers
                in the future.
            </p>

            <div class="founder-features">

                <div>✅ Customer Satisfaction</div>

                <div>✅ Safe & Comfortable Travel</div>

                <div>✅ Transparent Pricing</div>

                <div>✅ Professional Driver</div>

                <div>✅ Well-Maintained Vehicles</div>

                <div>✅ 24×7 WhatsApp Support</div>

            </div>

            <a
                href="https://wa.me/91YOURNUMBER"
                class="founder-btn"
                target="_blank"
            >
                Book your Journey today!
            </a>

        </div>

    </div>
</section>

<style>
.founder-section{
    padding:90px 20px;
    background:#f8fafc;
}

.founder-container{
    max-width:1200px;
    margin:auto;
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;
    gap:60px;
    align-items:center;
}

.founder-image img{
    width:100%;
    border-radius:20px;
    box-shadow:0 20px 50px rgba(0,0,0,.18);
    transition:.4s;
}

.founder-image img:hover{
    transform:scale(1.02);
}

.founder-tag{
    display:inline-block;
    background:#d4a12d;
    color:white;
    padding:8px 18px;
    border-radius:50px;
    font-weight:600;
    margin-bottom:15px;
}

.founder-content h2{
    font-size:42px;
    color:#0b2d2d;
    margin-bottom:20px;
}

blockquote{
    font-size:22px;
    font-style:italic;
    color:#444;
    border-left:5px solid #d4a12d;
    padding-left:20px;
    margin-bottom:25px;
    line-height:1.7;
}

.founder-content p{
    color:#555;
    font-size:18px;
    line-height:1.8;
    margin-bottom:20px;
}

.founder-features{
    display:grid;
    grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;
    gap:15px;
    margin:35px 0;
    font-weight:600;
    color:#0b2d2d;
}

.founder-btn{
    display:inline-block;
    background:#0b2d2d;
    color:#fff;
    text-decoration:none;
    padding:16px 34px;
    border-radius:50px;
    font-size:18px;
    font-weight:700;
    transition:.3s;
}

.founder-btn:hover{
    background:#d4a12d;
    color:#fff;
    transform:translateY(-3px);
}

@media(max-width:900px){

.founder-container{
    grid-template-columns:1fr;
}

.founder-content{
    text-align:center;
}

blockquote{
    text-align:left;
}

.founder-features{
    grid-template-columns:1fr;
}

}
</style>